message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "pytempo: Python access to INS TEMPO Online statistics"
abstract: >-
  A Python library for reading Romanian official statistics from the INS TEMPO
  Online API: finding indicators, reading their metadata, fetching data at any
  territorial level, and standardizing it with SIRUTA codes.
type: software
